# Current Phase — Phase 6

## Status

**COMPLETE AND VERIFIED**

## Objective

Connect: **Customer + Service → Application**

Implement full application lifecycle management with dynamic service fields, staff assignment, status workflow, and tenant isolation.

## Scope

**Phase 6 includes:**

- Application model
- Application migration
- Application number generation (format: `{SHOP_CODE}-{YEAR}-{SEQUENTIAL}`)
- Application status workflow (ENQUIRY → APPLIED → DOCUMENTS_PENDING → UNDER_PROCESSING → COMPLETED/REJECTED/CANCELLED)
- Customer relationship (shop-scoped)
- Service relationship (shop-scoped, archived services not allowed)
- Dynamic service fields (validated against ServiceField definitions)
- Staff assignment (shop-scoped membership validation)
- Application CRUD (create, read, update, list)
- Search (application number, customer name/mobile, service name)
- Filters (status, service, customer, assigned staff)
- Pagination
- Application RBAC (APPLICATION_VIEW, APPLICATION_CREATE, APPLICATION_UPDATE)
- Tenant isolation (all queries scoped by shop_id)
- Audit logging (create, update, assign, status_change)
- Frontend (list, create, detail, edit)
- Tests

## Out of Scope

**The following are intentionally future modules — DO NOT IMPLEMENT:**

- Documents
- Document uploads
- Document Center
- Payments
- Billing
- Invoices
- Receipts
- SMS
- WhatsApp
- Notifications
- Customer chat
- Staff chat
- Analytics
- Reports
- Subscriptions
- Coupons
- Offers

